{
  "id": 8860498428103,
  "title": "Custom Soccer Ball with Lightning Splash Comforter Set - A11",
  "handle": "custom-soccer-ball-with-lightning-splash-comforter-set-a11",
  "body_html": "<p>Inspire young soccer enthusiasts with this Jeminise Soccer Player Comforter Set, perfect for adding a sporty touch to any boy's room. This custom bedding set allows for personalization with a name and number, making it a thoughtful gift for any soccer fan.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Soccer Enthusiasm:</strong> Designed to fuel children's excitement for soccer, inspiring them to chase their dreams.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize this comforter set with a name and number for a unique touch.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy to Use:</strong> Features a hidden zipper and smooth metal pull for effortless duvet insertion and removal.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Utilizes environmental protection techniques to prevent fading and ensure lasting dye vibrancy with smooth, fine, and compact stitching.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> This set includes a duvet cover.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and dries quickly without heat, maintaining its fluffy texture.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Soccer</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>A4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Full</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Length</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Quantity</th>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Width</th>\n<td>20 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Sham Quantity</th>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style Name</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>360</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
